  "premise_review": [
    "PresheafOfSpectra has exactly obj:C.Obj→SpectrumObject and restrict:∀{X Y}, C.Hom Y X→SpectrumMorphism(obj X)(obj Y). Preserve C, every X/Y binder, direction and both fields unchanged; no composition/identity/naturality or descent law is added.",
    "The original SiteCategory provider has actual Obj/Hom/id/comp but no identity/associativity equations. The original SpectrumObject/SpectrumMorphism provider has real carrier/functions plus independent stable/preservation Props. They remain exact existing historical provider types, never substituted with a narrower or newly copied type.",
